Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UPATH}\">\\(\\operatorname{UPATH}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e41fc628b847852\" href=\"?note=8e41fc628b847852\" title=\"28-df-undirected-connectivity\">28-df-undirected-connectivity</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L\">\\(\\mathbf L\\)</span> 为只计工作带空间的确定型对数空间类，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e145640be927aa76\" href=\"?note=e145640be927aa76\" title=\"28-df-l\">28-df-l</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UPATH}\\in\\mathbf L.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{UPATH}\\in\\mathbf L.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已核对定理陈述，以及证明用平衡替换积和路径幂改善各连通分量谱隙的结构。完整算法还需递归邻居求值的空间分析，本次未完成独立证明核验，因此只标记陈述核对。输入矩阵的无向性与合法性也可在对数工作空间内扫描检查。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 21.21；印刷页 440–442；PDF 页 466–468。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-undirected-connectivity","status":"resolved","id":"8e41fc628b847852","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-undirected-connectivity]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-l","status":"resolved","id":"e145640be927aa76","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-l]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-undirected-connectivity","status":"resolved","id":"8e41fc628b847852","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{UPATH}$ 见 [[28-df-undirected-connectivity]]；$\\mathbf L$ 为只计工作带空间的确定型对数空间类，见 [[28-df-l]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-l","status":"resolved","id":"e145640be927aa76","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{UPATH}$ 见 [[28-df-undirected-connectivity]]；$\\mathbf L$ 为只计工作带空间的确定型对数空间类，见 [[28-df-l]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{UPATH}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UPATH}\\in\\mathbf L.","display":true}],"bytes":1340,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-393","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-graph-power]]、[[28-df-graph-tensor-product]]、[[28-df-replacement-product]]、[[28-thm-tensor-product-expansion]]、[[28-thm-replacement-product-expansion]]、[[28-df-flat-source]]、[[28-lem-flat-source-convex-decomposition]]、[[28-df-branching-program]]、[[28-df-undirected-connectivity]]、[[28-thm-reingold]]、[[28-df-space-bounded-prg]]、[[28-thm-nisan-space-prg]]。"}],"outgoing":["8e41fc628b847852","e145640be927aa76"]}